---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CV"
  description="江振瑜（CYJiang）的工作经历、开源角色与技术方向。"
>
  <article class="content cv-page">
    <header class="cv-header">
      <p class="profile-label">Curriculum Vitae</p>
      <h1>江振瑜</h1>
      <p class="profile-handle">CYJiang · @googs1025</p>
    </header>

    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="cv-summary">
      <h2 id="cv-summary">Professional Summary / 专业概览</h2>
      <p>
        云原生开发与基础设施工程师，专注 Kubernetes 调度、GPU
        资源管理与 LLM 推理基础设施。目前在马上消费金融从事云原生基础设施相关工作。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="cv-experience">
      <h2 id="cv-experience">Experience / 工作经历</h2>
      <div class="cv-entry">
        <h3>马上消费金融</h3>
        <p>从事云原生基础设施相关工作。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-entry">
        <h3>ByteDance</h3>
        <p>曾任云平台工程师。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="cv-open-source">
      <h2 id="cv-open-source">Open Source / 开源经历</h2>
      <ul class="role-list">
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes">Kubernetes</a>
          {" "}Member
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/vllm-project/aibrix">Aibrix</a>
          {" "}Maintainer
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/volcano-sh/volcano">Volcano</a>
          {" "}Member
        </li>
        <li>
          围绕
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/scheduler-plugins"
            >scheduler-plugins</a
          >
          与
          <a href="https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/descheduler">descheduler</a>
          参与工作、讨论和代码评审。
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="cv-focus">
      <h2 id="cv-focus">Technical Focus / 技术方向</h2>
      <ul class="fact-list">
        <li>Kubernetes 调度</li>
        <li>GPU 资源管理</li>
        <li>LLM 推理基础设施</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section" aria-labelledby="cv-contact">
      <h2 id="cv-contact">Contact / 联系方式</h2>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/googs1025">GitHub · googs1025</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:googs1025@gmail.com">googs1025@gmail.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
